<title>UK: Dominion's E.Midlands bid unconditional.</title>
<headline>Dominion's E.Midlands bid unconditional.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. group Dominion Resources announced on Friday that its agreed offer for regional electricity company (Rec) East Midlands was unconditional and that it had 85.7 percent of the company.</p>
<p>In a statement, Dominion said as of 1500 GMT on January 10 it had received acceptances representing around 70.7 percent of shares and had bought around 15 percent.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
